## Your monthly check-in visit

On a rental of about a month or longer, your trips page shows **Next check-in visit: around** a date. It is a quick, free visit (about 15 minutes) so we can keep the car in top shape and catch maintenance early. Nothing to pay, and it is a suggestion, not a requirement. A few days before, we send you a reminder: press **Pick a time** and choose a time at our office, or **By request** with when and where suits you. You can change the time or take it back.
